# bits-ui

Use **bits-ui** for interactive primitives. Do not hand-roll Tabs, Pagination, Dialog, Popover, Combobox, Select, or Command.

## When

Pagination, tabs, dialogs, popovers, combobox/select, command palettes, and similar controls.

## How

Wrap bits-ui in **`packages/ui`**, not per-app copies. Import from `@company-of-heroes/ui/*` in app and website.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Pagination } from '@company-of-heroes/ui/pagination';
</script>

<Pagination {page} {count} {perPage} onPage={setPage} />
```

Host-specific label strings (i18n) pass as optional props; English defaults live in the shared component.
